OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showery
OL,6,Flight rain clearing southeastwards
OL,7,Fthis evening, leaving a mostly clear
OL,8,Fand dry night. Isolated mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches may form in prone rural
OL,10,Flocations and here it will turn chilly
OL,11,Fwith perhaps some grass frost.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAny mist clearing through
OL,14,Fthe morning, then a dry day to come
OL,15,Fwith sunny periods and patchy cloud.
OL,16,FWith light winds it will feel rather
OL,17,Fwarm for September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
