OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,6,Fbreezier on Sunday with rain arriving
OL,7,Flater, perhaps heavy in places. Fine
OL,8,Fon Monday with some sunshine, then
OL,9,Fwindier but much warmer on Tuesday.
OL,10,FTemperatures staying above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
